><td>planned</td></tr><tr><td>Scrubber notes</td><td>Exempt, over 10 km from Nagpur (Jul 2025 notification as reported by The News Dirt (16 Jul 2025)). FGD for Koradi units 8–10 (3×660 MW) awarded Nov 2023, targeted May 2026 (Mahagenco annual report 2023-24); EC deadline 31 Dec 2026. Commissioning not confirmed.</td></tr><tr><td>Plants in the site</td><td>Mahagenco Koradi (2,400 MW), Mahagenco Khaparkheda (1,340 MW), 4 km apart</td></tr></table>]]></description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff333333</color><width>1</width></LineStyle><IconStyle><color>ff0000c0</color></IconStyle><PolyStyle><color>ff0000c0</color></PolyStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>79.10600,21.26200</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Tiroda (Adani)</name><description><![CDATA[<table><tr><td>Status</td><td>check first</td></tr><tr><td>Why</td><td>high SO₂</td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Coal power</td></tr><tr><td>District</td><td>Gondia</td></tr><tr><td>Capacity (MW)</td><td>3300</td></tr><tr><td>SO₂ above background, last 12 months (µmol/m²)</td><td>161.1</td></tr><tr><td>NO₂ above background, last 12 months (µmol/m²)</td><td>32.8</td></tr><tr><td>SO₂ ÷ NO₂</td><td>4.91</td></tr><tr><td>SO₂ change, latest Jan–May vs 2021-2024</td><td>-0.292</td></tr><tr><td>Scrubber (FGD)</td><td>no</td></tr><tr><td>Scrubber notes</td><td>Category C, exempt (Jul 2025 notification as reported by The News Dirt (16 Jul 2025)).</td></tr><tr><td>Plants in the site</td><td>Adani Power Tiroda (3,300 MW)</td></tr></table>]]></description><Style><LineStyle><color>ff333333</color><width>1</width></LineStyle><IconStyle><color>ff0000c0</color></IconStyle><PolyStyle><color>ff0000c0</color></PolyStyle></Style><Point><coordinates>79.96710,21.41290</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>Mauda (NTPC)</name><description><![CDATA[<table><tr><td>Status</td><td>watch</td></tr><tr><td>Why</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Type</td><td>Coal power</td></tr><tr><td>District</td><td>Nagpur</td></tr><tr><td>Capacity (MW)</td><t